    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰλιός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spotted, dappled,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαφος, λύγκες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alc.</u>
				579
			</span></i> (both lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρδιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.203
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Simm.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> parox.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλίος,</span> as name of one of
			Achilles' horses, <i>Piebald, Dapple,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.149
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				222
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>swift,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				9.156
			</span></i>, al.</div>
